OL,3,AAunt killed in fire with niece was
OL,4,A'beautiful soul'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman killed in a house fire has been
OL,7,Fdescribed by her mother as "a beautiful
OL,8,Fsoul, who would have done anything for
OL,9,Fanybody"
OL,11,FNatalie McDonald, 34, died along with
OL,12,Fher seven-year-old niece, Valentina
OL,13,FFoster, in the fire in the early hours
OL,14,Fin Grangetown, near Middlesbrough.
OL,16,FCleveland Police said the fire broke
OL,17,Fout in the early hours of Wednesday
OL,18,Fwhich also left a 48-year-old woman in
OL,19,Fa critical condition in hospital
OL,20,Falongside another three people who
OL,21,Fsuffered non-life threatening injuries.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
